---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Security Center & Proteksi Akun - Yasui Game"
    description="Panduan keamanan aset dan akun game setelah pembelian di Yasui Game."
>
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pt-4 md:pt-6 pb-20">
        <header
            class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-10 border-b border-[#222634] pb-6"
        >
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                    <span
                        class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#00E5FF] uppercase tracking-wider border border-[#00E5FF]/30 bg-[#00E5FF]/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"
                    >
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#00E5FF]"></span>
                        SECURITY PROTOCOL
                    </span>
                </div>
                <h1
                    class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight uppercase"
                >
                    Security Center
                </h1>
                <p class="text-[#94A3B8] font-mono text-xs md:text-sm mt-1">
                    Standar operasional perlindungan aset digital setelah serah terima akun.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] rounded-lg p-1">
                <button
                    type="button"
                    id="btn-id"
                    onclick="window.selectLanguage ? window.selectLanguage('id') : switchLang('id')"
                    class="px-3 py-1 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold transition-all bg-[#00E5FF]/10 text-[#00E5FF] border border-[#00E5FF]/40 cursor-pointer"
                >
                    INDONESIA
                </button>
                <button
                    type="button"
                    id="btn-en"
                    onclick="window.selectLanguage ? window.selectLanguage('en') : switchLang('en')"
                    class="px-3 py-1 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#94A3B8] hover:text-white transition-all cursor-pointer border border-transparent"
                >
                    ENGLISH
                </button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="space-y-6">
            <article
                id="content-id"
                class="space-y-6"
            >
                <div
                    class="bg-[#11131A] border-l-2 border-amber-500 border-y border-r border-[#222634] p-4 rounded-r-lg"
                >
                    <p class="text-[#F8FAFC] font-mono text-xs italic leading-relaxed">
                        "Akun game yang baru Anda terima adalah aset digital berharga. Ikuti panduan keamanan di bawah ini untuk mencegah kehilangan akses atau kompromi akun."
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] rounded-lg p-6 space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-[#00E5FF] font-bold">
                        <span>[01]</span>
                        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Ganti Kata Sandi Segera</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[#94A3B8] text-xs leading-relaxed">
                        Langkah awal terpenting setelah menerima kredensial akun adalah memperbarui <b class="text-[#F8FAFC]">Password Email</b> dan <b class="text-[#F8FAFC]">Password Akun Game</b>. Hindari penggunaan kata sandi yang sama dengan akun media sosial pribadi Anda.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-[#94A3B8] space-y-1 font-mono pt-1">
                        <li>Kombinasi huruf besar & kecil (A-Z, a-z)</li>
                        <li>Angka acak (0-9)</li>
                        <li>Karakter simbol unik (!, @, #, $, %)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] rounded-lg p-6 space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-[#00E5FF] font-bold">
                        <span>[02]</span>
                        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Aktifkan Autentikasi 2 Faktor (2FA)</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[#94A3B8] text-xs leading-relaxed">
                        Aktifkan verifikasi dua langkah (2FA / Two-Factor Authentication) pada alamat email yang terikat dengan akun game. Kami menyarankan penggunaan aplikasi autentikator mandiri seperti <b class="text-[#F8FAFC]">Google Authenticator</b> atau <b class="text-[#F8FAFC]">Authy</b> dibandingkan SMS untuk memitigasi risiko pembajakan nomor seluler (SIM swap).
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-red-950/20 border border-red-500/40 p-5 rounded-lg">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <div class="i-lucide-alert-triangle text-red-400 text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-red-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
                                [03] Kebijakan Keamanan OTP: Peringatan Keras
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-[#94A3B8] leading-relaxed">
                                Seluruh staf dan Admin Yasui Game <b class="text-white">TIDAK AKAN PERNAH</b> meminta kode OTP, PIN verifikasi, atau token sesi login Anda untuk alasan teknis apapun. Siapapun yang meminta kode tersebut dengan mengatasnamakan Yasui Game adalah pihak yang berniat melakukan penipuan.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] rounded-lg p-6 space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-[#00E5FF] font-bold">
                        <span>[04]</span>
                        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Putuskan Sesi Perangkat Lain (Force Logout)</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[#94A3B8] text-xs leading-relaxed">
                        Masuk ke menu pengaturan akun (Security / Device Management) pada platform game atau provider email terkait, lalu pilih opsi <b class="text-[#F8FAFC]">"Log Out from All Other Devices"</b> untuk menghentikan akses sesi dari perangkat lama secara permanen.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article
                id="content-en"
                class="hidden space-y-6"
            >
                <div
                    class="bg-[#11131A] border-l-2 border-amber-500 border-y border-r border-[#222634] p-4 rounded-r-lg"
                >
                    <p class="text-[#F8FAFC] font-mono text-xs italic leading-relaxed">
                        "Your newly acquired game account is a valuable digital asset. Follow these operational guidelines to guarantee security and complete account ownership."
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] rounded-lg p-6 space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-[#00E5FF] font-bold">
                        <span>[01]</span>
                        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Change Passwords Immediately</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[#94A3B8] text-xs leading-relaxed">
                        Immediately update both the <b class="text-[#F8FAFC]">Email Password</b> and the <b class="text-[#F8FAFC]">Game Account Password</b>. Do not reuse credentials from your personal social media accounts.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-[#94A3B8] space-y-1 font-mono pt-1">
                        <li>Uppercase & lowercase letters (A-Z, a-z)</li>
                        <li>Random numbers (0-9)</li>
                        <li>Unique symbols (!, @, #, $, %)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] rounded-lg p-6 space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-[#00E5FF] font-bold">
                        <span>[02]</span>
                        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Enable Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[#94A3B8] text-xs leading-relaxed">
                        Turn on two-factor authentication on the primary email tied to the game account. We strongly recommend using dedicated authenticator applications such as <b class="text-[#F8FAFC]">Google Authenticator</b> or <b class="text-[#F8FAFC]">Authy</b> over SMS verification.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-red-950/20 border border-red-500/40 p-5 rounded-lg">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <div class="i-lucide-alert-triangle text-red-400 text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-red-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
                                [03] Zero-Trust OTP Policy: Strict Warning
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-[#94A3B8] leading-relaxed">
                                Yasui Game staff and administrators will <b class="text-white">NEVER</b> ask for your OTP codes, verification numbers, or login tokens. Any individual asking for sensitive codes under our name is an unauthorized scammer.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] rounded-lg p-6 space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-[#00E5FF] font-bold">
                        <span>[04]</span>
                        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Force Logout All Other Sessions</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[#94A3B8] text-xs leading-relaxed">
                        Navigate to the Security or Device Management section within the game settings and primary email, and trigger <b class="text-[#F8FAFC]">"Log Out All Other Devices"</b> to permanently invalidate prior sessions.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>

        <section class="mt-12 border-t border-[#222634] pt-8">
            <div
                class="bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] p-6 rounded-lg flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6"
            >
                <div>
                    <h3
                        class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase font-mono tracking-wider mb-1"
                        id="cta-title"
                    >
                        Butuh Panduan Khusus per Game?
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-[#94A3B8] text-xs max-w-md" id="cta-desc">
                        Hubungi Support Yasui Game via WhatsApp untuk konsultasi pengamanan akun Summoners War, Roblox, Mobile Legends, dan lainnya.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <a
                    href="https://wa.me/6285972775966"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="yg-btn-secondary flex items-center gap-2 text-xs shrink-0"
                >
                    <div class="i-lucide-message-circle text-emerald-400"></div>
                    <span id="cta-btn">WhatsApp Support Resmi</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script is:inline>
        const btnId = document.getElementById("btn-id");
        const btnEn = document.getElementById("btn-en");
        const contentId = document.getElementById("content-id");
        const contentEn = document.getElementById("content-en");
        const ctaTitle = document.getElementById("cta-title");
        const ctaDesc = document.getElementById("cta-desc");
        const ctaBtn = document.getElementById("cta-btn");

        window.switchLang = function(lang) {
            if (lang === "id") {
                if (btnId) btnId.className = "px-3 py-1 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold transition-all bg-[#00E5FF]/10 text-[#00E5FF] border border-[#00E5FF]/40 cursor-pointer";
                if (btnEn) btnEn.className = "px-3 py-1 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#94A3B8] hover:text-white transition-all cursor-pointer border border-transparent";
                contentId?.classList.remove("hidden");
                contentEn?.classList.add("hidden");
                if (ctaTitle) ctaTitle.innerText = "Butuh Panduan Khusus per Game?";
                if (ctaDesc) ctaDesc.innerText = "Hubungi Support Yasui Game via WhatsApp untuk konsultasi pengamanan akun Summoners War, Roblox, Mobile Legends, dan lainnya.";
                if (ctaBtn) ctaBtn.innerText = "WhatsApp Support Resmi";
            } else {
                if (btnEn) btnEn.className = "px-3 py-1 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold transition-all bg-[#00E5FF]/10 text-[#00E5FF] border border-[#00E5FF]/40 cursor-pointer";
                if (btnId) btnId.className = "px-3 py-1 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#94A3B8] hover:text-white transition-all cursor-pointer border border-transparent";
                contentId?.classList.add("hidden");
                contentEn?.classList.remove("hidden");
                if (ctaTitle) ctaTitle.innerText = "Need Specific Game Guidance?";
                if (ctaDesc) ctaDesc.innerText = "Contact Yasui Game Support via WhatsApp for account protection guidelines for Summoners War, Roblox, Mobile Legends, and more.";
                if (ctaBtn) ctaBtn.innerText = "Official WhatsApp Support";
            }
        };

        const initialLang = localStorage.getItem("yasui_lang") || "id";
        window.switchLang(initialLang);
        window.addEventListener("yasui-lang-change", (e) => {
            window.switchLang(e.detail?.lang || localStorage.getItem("yasui_lang") || "id");
        });
    </script>
</Layout>
